   "widgets": [
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">QUALITY</p>\n    <h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Multi-stage testing from raw material to finished bottle.</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Every batch of private label product passes through a multi-stage testing protocol covering identity, potency, contaminants, microbials, and stability. Quality is what your brand inherits when you partner with us.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201608879,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Why testing protocols matter more than marketing claims.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Most supplement brands claim 'tested for purity and potency.' Few actually publish their testing protocols. Here's how testing works at our facility.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Every raw material is tested on receipt for identity (is this actually what was ordered) and quality (does it meet our specifications). Every batch is tested during production for potency. Every finished product is tested for contaminants, heavy metals, and microbial limits. Random samples go to third-party labs for verification.</p>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201608880,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.75 3.1v5.66m4.5-5.66v5.66m-4.5 0a3.38 3.38 0 0 1-1.5 6.43m6-6.43a3.38 3.38 0 0 0 1.5 6.43M4.5 19.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5 4.5h6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5-4.5v-4.31a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5-4.5h-6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5 4.5v4.31Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Raw material identity testing</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Every incoming raw material is tested to confirm identity before it enters production. Prevents misidentified or substituted ingredients from reaching your customers.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M12 3v17.25m0 0a47.78 47.78 0 0 1 3.83.15M12 20.25a47.78 47.78 0 0 0-3.83.15M9.16 8.34h5.66c1.04 0 2 .49 2.62 1.33L21 14.25H3l3.55-4.58a3.31 3.31 0 0 1 2.62-1.33ZM12 8.25c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75m11.25 3.75c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Potency verification</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Active ingredient levels are tested at multiple stages to confirm your label claims match actual product. What's on the label is what's in the bottle.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Contaminant screening</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Testing for heavy metals (lead, arsenic, mercury, cadmium), microbial contamination, pesticide residues, and other regulated contaminants.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.04L9.34 4.7l-3.94.34a1.69 1.69 0 0 0-1.36 1.36L3.7 10.34 2.7 12l1.04 2.66.34 3.94c.13.7.65 1.23 1.36 1.36l3.94.34L9.66 21.3 12 22.3l2.66-1.04 3.94-.34a1.69 1.69 0 0 0 1.36-1.36l.34-3.94 1.04-2.66-1.04-2.66-.34-3.94a1.69 1.69 0 0 0-1.36-1.36l-3.94-.34L12 2.7Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Third-party verification</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Random samples sent to independent third-party laboratories for verification. Independent eyes on our internal testing results.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201608881,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your private label supplement line?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation. We will walk through your audience, the right formulations for them, branding options, and the timeline.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
